      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The r10.5.0 hflush call alone cannot establish crash durability: Hadoop 3.3.6 defines hflush as visibility without a durability guarantee. The helper also closes the stream, so successful-close behavior must be assessed separately. (medium confidence)",
