          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In r10.5.0, MongoScan forwards its checkpointLocation argument unchanged to the selected streaming implementation. Both implementations construct MongoOffsetStore, delegate initialOffset(), and call updateOffset(end) from commit(); stop() only logs. (low confidence)",
