          "text": "For an ABFS deployment, inspect fs.azure.enable.flush: Hadoop 3.3.6 documents disabling it as making hflush/hsync no-ops. Microsoft separately documents the service distinction between intermediate flush and final close; these are not interchangeable lifecycle events. (medium confidence)",
